{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A well temperament is fully defined by the sizes of its twelve perfect fifths around","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the circle. ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/fifths","isActive":true},{"text":" maps each ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/Fifth","isActive":true},{"text":" to its frequency ratio. Any fifth not","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"present in the map is assumed to be a pure 3:2.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"For the tuning to be internally consistent, the product of all twelve fifths must equal","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"2⁷ (seven octaves), closing the circle. This invariant is not enforced at init time,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"but all predefined constants satisfy it exactly.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The interval of equivalence is an octave (2:1). All predefined well temperaments fully","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"support standard pitch notation via ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/standardConversion(for:)","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivortuning\/welltemperament"]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/SQ","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/TuningSystem"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:10IvorTuning15WellTemperamentV","modules":[{"name":"IvorTuning"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","title":"WellTemperament","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WellTemperament","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"struct"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"A tuning system in which all twelve keys are usable but have distinct tonal characters,","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"achieved by distributing the Pythagorean comma unevenly around the circle of fifths."}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/init(fifths:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/fifths"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/Fifth"],"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"title":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/Equatable-Implementations","doc:\/\/IvorTuning\/documentation\/IvorTuning\/WellTemperament\/TuningSystem-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://IvorTuning/documentation/IvorTuning/